text: |-
  HustleBitch • @HustleBitch_ • 10m
  CANDACE OWENS: "THE CORONER WAS BRAND SPANKING NEW"...
  AND SO WAS THE SURGEON
  ...
  Candace reveals everyone connected to Charlie Kirk's case was new.
  • A new FBI director and new FBI members in Utah after "cleaning house."
  • A new CEO and a new lead surgeon at the hospital, ranked extremely low
  in treating traumatic neck wounds, and not even the closest hospital to
  UVU.
  • A new judge, appointed May 2025 by Gov. Cox.
  • And the coroner? "BRAND. SPANKING. NEW."
  Candace: "9/10 was everybody's first day on the job."
  A brand new surgeon on the front end.
  A brand new coroner on the back end.
  All new faces. All key positions.
  When EVERY key player is brand new, is that really coincidence or a setup
  for assassination?
